// g-bootstrap-else-if-else-attrs-ignored (orphan limbs): an `else` with no `if=` sibling; an `else-if=` with none.
<program>
    let <step:int=1/>
    <main>
        <p id="a">A</p>
        <p id="b" else>B</p>
        <div>
            <p id="c" else-if=(@step == 2)>C</p>
        </div>
    </main>
</program>
